Subject: Any way to set number of decimal places?
Message-ID: <_lE0YLqAebc.mlWKwOigCQAJ@deducer.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/deducer/c/_lE0YLqAebc/m/mlWKwOigCQAJ>
